stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Armed
  Armed --> Counting: condition true
  Counting --> Counting: true and count below required
  Counting --> Triggered: required consecutive matches
  Triggered --> DurableIntent: atomic execution and gated outbox transaction
  DurableIntent --> ActionInProgress: mark before physical action
  ActionInProgress --> Finalized: persist actual actuator and BLE outcome
  ActionInProgress --> OutcomeUnknown: process death and restart
  Finalized --> WaitingForReset: release finalized outbox payload
  OutcomeUnknown --> WaitingForReset: release recovery payload without replay
  WaitingForReset --> WaitingForReset: condition remains true
  WaitingForReset --> Cooldown: condition false
  Cooldown --> Armed: elapsed time reaches cooldown
  Counting --> Armed: condition false
